{"t":"AXON","made":"2026-11-07 10:12","name":"Axon Enterprise, Inc.","ko":"액손","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":5100,"hq":"Scottsdale, AZ, United States","website":"https://www.axon.com","summary_en":"Axon Enterprise, Inc. provides public safety technology solutions in the United States and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Software and Services, and Connected Devices. The Software and Services segment develops, manufactures, and sells cloud-based software-as-a-service solutions to capture, store, manage, share, and analyze video and other digital evidence. This segment also offers Axon Evidence, Draft One, Axon Records, Axon Standards, Axon Fusus, Axon Assistant, and others. The Connected Devices segment engages in the development, manufacture, and sale of integrated hardware solutions, such as conducted energy devices under the TASER brand, body cameras, fixed and in-car cameras, drone and counter-drone technologies, accessories, extended warranties, and related hardware products, as well as virtual reality training hardware. The company serves first responders across international, federal, state, and local governments, international governmental entities, commercial enterprises, and consumers through direct sales, distribution partners, and third-party resellers. The company was formerly known as TASER International, Inc. and changed its name to Axon Enterprise, Inc. in April 2017. Axon Enterprise, Inc. was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Scottsdale, Arizona.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Axon Enterprise, Inc.는 미국 및 국제적으로 공공 안전 기술 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 소프트웨어 및 서비스 부문과 연결된 장치 부문으로 운영됩니다. 소프트웨어 및 서비스 부문은 비디오 및 기타 디지털 증거를 캡처, 저장, 관리, 공유 및 분석하기 위한 클라우드 기반 SaaS(Software-as-a-Service) 솔루션을 개발, 제조 및 판매합니다. 이 세그먼트에는 Axon Evidence, Draft One, Axon Records, Axon Standards, Axon Fusus, Axon Assistant 등도 제공됩니다. 연결된 장치 부문은 TASER 브랜드의 전도 에너지 장치, 신체 카메라, 고정 및 차량용 카메라, 드론 및 카운터 드론 기술, 액세서리, 연장 보증, 관련 하드웨어 제품, 가상 현실 훈련 하드웨어 등 통합 하드웨어 솔루션의 개발, 제조 및 판매에 참여합니다. 이 회사는 직접 판매, 유통 파트너 및 제3자 리셀러를 통해 국제, 연방, 주 및 지방 정부, 국제 정부 기관, 영리 기업 및 소비자 전반에 걸쳐 응급 구조원에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 TASER International, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2017년 4월에 Axon Enterprise, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Axon Enterprise, Inc.는 1993년에 설립되었으며 애리조나주 스코츠데일에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":313.0,"mcap":25427310592.0,"pe":129.87552,"fpe":29.771559,"peg":1.3755,"ps":7.4413877,"pb":6.7411857,"ev_ebitda":119.424,"div":0.0,"beta":null,"hi52":665.07,"lo52":307.0},"fin":{"rev":3417011968.0,"rev_g":0.279,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.58668,"op":0.04632,"net":0.07565,"roe":0.07613,"fcf":105801248.0,"cash":1655154944.0,"debt":2968898048.0,"de":78.899,"eps":2.41,"feps":10.51339},"own":{"short":0.0592,"inst":0.91359,"insider":0.04506},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":680.3684,"median":688.0,"high":830.0,"low":440.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.66667,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":8,"buy":10,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":8,"buy":10,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":8,"buy":10,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":8,"buy":10,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":615.0,"priorPriceTarget":735.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":540.0,"priorPriceTarget":561.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Needham","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":500.0,"priorPriceTarget":750.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":800.0,"priorPriceTarget":825.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Piper Sandler